rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="pone.0000318-Rankin1">&#x0005b;42&#x0005d;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Rad21-W</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">GGUGAAAAUGGCAUUACGG(dTdT)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="pone.0000318-Watrin1">&#x0005b;7&#x0005d;</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Smc3-p</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">CAGCGGUUGGCUUUAUUGC(dTdT)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">This work</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></sec><fn-group><fn fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests: </bold>The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>This work was funded by NIH grant CA099033 (D.J.C.) and J.F.G.A was partly supported by MEC-Spain DGI and L.A.D.M. by CONACyT.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>